iewers. Discuss pricing models, legal considerations, and how to market your AI agent skills effectively.\"\n    ],\n    \"cta\": \"If this video helped you understand AI agents, drop a comment below with what you want to build first! Don’t forget to LIKE, SUBSCRIBE, and hit that BELL icon for more tech tutorials. Want to dive deeper? Check out the free AI agent template pack in the video description – it’s a game-changer for beginners!\",\n    \"estimated_duration\": \"25 Minutes\"\n}\n"